@startuml
title PJ1 Phase 1 — planned component dependencies
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
component "main\ncomposition root" as Main
component "cli\nREPL / tokenizer / registry" as Cli
component "application\ncommands / session / history / ports" as App
component "domain\ndocument / shape composite / factory" as Domain
component "presentation\ntree / show / help formatting" as Presentation
component "infrastructure\nfile system / SVG XML codec" as Infra
Main --> Cli
Main --> App
Main --> Presentation
Main --> Infra
Cli --> App
App --> Domain
Presentation --> Domain
Presentation --> App : implements output ports
Infra --> App : implements ports
Infra --> Domain
note bottom of Domain
  No Node.js, terminal, XML library,
  application or infrastructure imports.
end note
note bottom of App
  Commands use output/file interfaces.
  Concrete adapters are injected in main.
end note
@enduml
